{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは、池田瑛紗です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日個展『Wings:あひるの夢』が無事終了しました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "長かったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1ヶ月もね、こうして自分のあれこれを観ていただける場を作ることができたのはもちろん、その準備も含めたら1年は私のそばにこの個展はあった訳ですから…でも、終わってしまえばあっという間です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寂しさ、感謝。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "の気持ちが大きいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来てくださったみなさんの存在があってこそのチャンスでしたし、今回携わっていただいた方々の存在、タイミング、なにかひとつ欠けていたら今は無かったと思うので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんの方のお力をお借りしてここまで辿り着きました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全てに感謝を込めまして、本当にありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobKES1eR.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ん〜てれさぱんだ発見👀！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また皆さんがわくわくするようなコンテンツを作れたらいいな〜と思っております。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "む…難しいけどね 楽しみです☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "つい最近だと、ミーグリとらじらー！に参加させていただきました ありがとうございましたm(_ _)m"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "普段はあまり喋らずに過ごす私もこの日は誰よりもお話していた気がする ミーグリ後にらじらーに参加させていただくとギアがかかりっぱです☺️☺️☺️たのしいたのしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さくたんとオズワルドさんおふたりとだとは、スタ誕の収録に戻ったようで懐かしくなります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また近いうちに伺いたいです！えへ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob0f54W6.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この前あそびに行った時の"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "遊ぶみんなのことを動画に残そうとしたら、倒れて空ばかり写っていました꙳⋆(lllᵔ⩌ᵔlll)౨♪がーん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リベンジを、果たそうっみんなで。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はこの辺で みなさん風邪をひきませぬよう…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#本日の1曲⇢君に届け/flumpool"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "